        desc = "DXNRDQNBDL0. PROVENANCE: PROVEN name/offset: DDR_PHY_DXNRDQNBDL0(n) at 0x21C + (n << 7) with the lane window at PHY + 0x200 (ddr_phy_t28.h); the lane window is also written at a few offsets by the CV300 init table (listed in the PHY description).";
